   {
    "primary": {
     "type": "TextChapter",
     "page_section_element_title": [],
     "page_section_element_body": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "Aalto Design system library consists of components, modules, sections, and design tokens that are required to build Aalto’s digital products. To start using Aalto Design system libraries in your Figma project, you will need access to the design system library project in Aalto’s Figma. To obtain access, kindly reach out to the Design system team.",
       "spans": []
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "If you find that the current design is missing elements or is not usable with your platform, we encourage you to reach out to the Design system team to discuss the possibilities for expanding the shared libraries.",
       "spans": []
      }
     ],
     "component_id": null,
     "component_figma_link": {
      "link_type": "Any"
     },
     "plain_component_preview": false,
     "react_code_preview": false,
