      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "Aalto uses an icon font that can be easily inserted and styled using font ligatures. You need to download the Aalto icon font to edit icon parameters like colors or sizing. Download the font and install it on your computer. Once the font is installed, you can insert icons into your design with the icon ligature names.",
       "spans": [],
       "direction": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "Download aalto-icons font files",
