       "text": "1. Download the icon files using the link above\n2. Extract the .zip archive on your local computer (typically just double click it)\n3. In the folder, locate the font file /fonts/aalto-icons.ttf\n4. Install the font into your local computer\n5. Close Figma and restart\n6. Select aalto-icons from the fonts list in the Text panel\n7. Add an icon by typing the corresponding ligature name, for example icon-quotation-marks",
